# Backend (apps/be) that /api/v1/* is forwarded to. Read when `next dev` / `next build` starts.
# Optional, default http://localhost:4000. Hosted demo: https://api.hellonear.xyz
HELLONEAR_API_URL=
# Hosted only: the API's public URL, called directly from the browser (same site as the FE, so the
# session cookie is sent and the backend sees each visitor's IP). Leave empty in local dev to use
# the proxy above. Hosted demo: https://api.hellonear.xyz (it must list the FE in FE_ORIGIN).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
